OL,3,GNEWSAAcademy aims to tackle shortage of
OL,4,Anew butchers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new academy is aiming to tackle a
OL,7,Fshortage of young people with the
OL,8,Fskills and knowledge needed to sustain
OL,9,Fthe butchery industry.
OL,11,FThe academy, at Duchy College's Stoke
OL,12,FClimsland campus, will offer
OL,13,Fapprenticeships developed with Cornwall
OL,14,Femployers.
OL,16,FButchery businesses, including Dunbia,
OL,17,FKepak, Philip Warren & Son,
OL,18,FEtheringtons and Kittows, have said
OL,19,Fthey are looking to recruit and develop
OL,20,Fskilled people.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
