OL,3,GNEWSAAcademy aims to tackle shortage of
OL,4,Anew butchers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe college said apprenticeships would
OL,7,Fcombine "practical butchery training
OL,8,Fwith the wider knowledge of food
OL,9,Fproduction and the farm-to-fork
OL,10,Fjourney".
